{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564700/extras/Game_Logo.png?t=1742506057\" /><strong>9 Trials of Whiskers</strong> is a <strong>charming yet challenging 3D platformer</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, jump and dodge hazards as you challenge each of the 9 Trials.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564700/extras/Level_5_02.png?t=1742506057\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play in <strong>Tourist Mode</strong> for a relaxing experience or push your limits in <strong>Hard Mode</strong> to master every trial and compete with <strong>your own ghost runs!</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564700/extras/Ghost_2.png?t=1742506057\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See you in the Trials =(^_^)=</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564700/extras/Level_10.png?t=1742506057\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3564700?t=1742506057","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564700/8fed2ddc6fc2ba308b0d77c2befcf4303c80aada/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742506057","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564700/ce56e04f1be45c3c837fd17263450323b9deb561/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742506057","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564700/ce56e04f1be45c3c837fd17263450323b9deb561/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742506057","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.